{"abstract":"The OCC, as part of its continuing effort to reduce paperwork and respondent burden, invites comment on a continuing information collection, as required by the Paperwork Reduction Act of 1995 (PRA). In accordance with the requirements of the PRA, the OCC may not conduct or sponsor, and the respondent is not required to respond to, an information collection unless it displays a currently valid Office of Management and Budget (OMB) control number. The OCC is soliciting comment concerning the revision to its information collection titled, \"Survey of OCC-Supervised Community Banks.\"","action":"Notice and request for comment.","agencies":[{"raw_name":"EXECUTIVE OFFICE OF THE PRESIDENT","name":"Executive Office of the President","id":538,"url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/executive-office-of-the-president","json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/538","parent_id":null,"slug":"executive-office-of-the-president"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2025/06/09/2025-10396.html","cfr_references":[],"citation":"90 FR 24313","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":"2025-08-08","correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":"Comments must be received by August 8, 2025.","disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":[],"dockets":[],"document_number":"2025-10396","effective_on":null,"end_page":24314,"executive_order_notes":null,"executive_order_number":null,"explanation":null,"full_text_xml_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/xml/2025/06/09/2025-10396.xml","html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2025/06/09/2025-10396/agency-information-collection-activities-information-collection-renewal-comment-request-survey-of","images":{},"images_metadata":{},"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/documents/2025-10396?publication_date=2025-06-09","mods_url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/metadata/granule/FR-2025-06-09/2025-10396/mods.xml","not_received_for_publication":null,"pag